    "description": "**Related:** WAGR-464 (Redeposits workflow — design and user stories), WAGR-397, WAGR-71\n\n**Summary:** When a BA leaves, their players need a new BA. Emily says redeposits depend on this (Aug 18). No design or card covers it.\n\n**Requirements captured:** Ops moves one Player, or many Players at once, to another BA. The change history is kept. Open redeposit assignments move with the Player, or they do not — decide which.\n\n**Open questions:** Who can do this? What happens to Sign-Ups that are in flight? Does the CMS need to know?\n\n**Done when:** a design is reviewed, and the stories are created.\n\n**Sources (traceable):**\n\n* Weekly sync, 2026-08-18 (Emily: redeposits need BA reassignment) — https://fathom.video/calls/787411922\n\n---\n\n_Captured 2026-09-25 by Kobi from the WagerTech calls, Slack, Jira and sandbox review (Jul–Sep 2026). Design backlog item: requirements only, not a solution._",
